"text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"செம்மல்","tr":"cemmal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செம்","tr":"cem"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மல்","tr":"mal"}]},{"text":"தேரே","tr":"tērē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"கானம்","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest"},{"surface":"கோழி","parts":[{"text":"கோழி","lemma":"கோழி","gloss":"fowl"}],"gloss":"fowl"},{"surface":"கவர்","parts":[{"text":"கவர்","lemma":"கவர்","gloss":"desire/attract"}],"gloss":"calling/attractive"},{"surface":"குரல்","parts":[{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"குரல்","gloss":"voice"}],"gloss":"voiced"},{"surface":"சேவல்","parts":[{"text":"சேவல்","lemma":"சேவல்","gloss":"rooster"}],"gloss":"rooster"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒண்பொறி","parts":[{"text":"ஒண்பொறி","lemma":"ஒண்பொறி","gloss":"bright-spotted"}],"gloss":"bright-spotted","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எருத்தின்","parts":[{"text":"எருத்து","lemma":"எருத்து","gloss":"neck"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique suffix"}],"gloss":"on the neck"},{"surface":"தண்சிதர்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"சிதர்","lemma":"சிதர்","gloss":"drop"}],"gloss":"cool drops"},{"surface":"உறைப்ப","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"drip"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ப்ப","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to drip"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புதனீர்","parts":[{"text":"புதனீர்","lemma":"புதனீர்","gloss":"water from the bushes"}],"gloss":"water from the bushes","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாரும்","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"flow"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"flowing"},{"surface":"பூநாறு","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"நாறு","lemma":"நாறு","gloss":"smell"}],"gloss":"flower-fragrant"},{"surface":"புறவின்","parts":[{"text":"புறவு","lemma":"புறவு","gloss":"woodland"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique suffix"}],"gloss":"of the woodland"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சீறூர்","parts":[{"text":"சீறூர்","lemma":"சீறூர்","gloss":"small village"}],"gloss":"small village","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஓளே","parts":[{"text":"ஓள்","lemma":"அவள்","gloss":"she"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she indeed is in"},{"surface":"மடந்தை","parts":[{"text":"மடந்தை","lemma":"மடந்தை","gloss":"young woman"}],"gloss":"the young woman"},{"surface":"வேறூர்","parts":[{"text":"வேறு","lemma":"வேறு","gloss":"other"},{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"}],"gloss":"to another town"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேந்துவிடு","parts":[{"text":"வேந்து","lemma":"வேந்தன்","gloss":"king"},{"text":"விடு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"send"}],"gloss":"sent by the king"},{"surface":"தொழிலொடு","parts":[{"text":"தொழில்","lemma":"தொழில்","gloss":"duty"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with duty"},{"surface":"செலினும்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"go"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"conditional suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even if he goes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சேந்துவரல்","parts":[{"text":"சேந்து","lemma":"சேந்து","gloss":"delaying/staying"},{"text":"வரல்","lemma":"வரல்","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"staying and returning"},{"surface":"அறியாது","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ஆது","lemma":"ஆது","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without knowing"},{"surface":"செம்மல்","parts":[{"text":"செம்மல்","lemma":"செம்மல்","gloss":"lord"}],"gloss":"the lord's"},{"surface":"தேரே","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"chariot indeed"}]}],"literal":"Forest fowl calling-voiced rooster / bright-spotted neck-on cool-drops to-drip, / bush-water flowing flower-fragrant woodland's / small-village-in-she-is-indeed, the young woman; to another town, / king-sent duty-with even-if-he-goes, / staying-and-returning not-knowing, the lord's chariot indeed.","translation":"The young woman is in the small village in the flower-fragrant woodland, where water from the bushes drips onto the bright-spotted neck of the calling forest rooster. Even if he goes to another town on a mission sent by the king, the lord's chariot does not know how to delay its return.","modern":"காட்டுக் கோழியாகிய கூவுகின்ற குரலையுடைய சேவலின் ஒளிரும் புள்ளிகளையுடைய கழுத்தில், புதர்களிலிருந்து வழியும் குளிர்ந்த நீர்த்துளிகள் சிந்துமாறு விழும், மலர்கள் மணக்கும் முல்லை நிலத்துச் சிற்றூரில் அந்த இளம்பெண் இருக்கிறாள். அரசன் ஏவிய கடமையின் காரணமாக வேறொரு ஊருக்குச் சென்றாலும், நம் தலைவனுடைய தேர் அங்கே தங்கித் திரும்புதலை அறியாது விரைந்து வந்துவிடும்.","explanation":"The foster-mother speaks to herself, expressing her confidence in the hero's swift return to the heroine. The poem is set in the Mullai tiṇai (forest landscape), which is associated with the rainy season and patient waiting. The image of the forest rooster getting drenched by water dripping from the bushes signals the onset of the rains, the time designated for the hero's return. The foster-mother reassures herself that the hero's love is so strong that his chariot will not delay even for a moment once his duty to the king is finished. Key words include 'புறவு' (woodland), 'மடந்தை' (young woman), and 'சேந்துவரல் அறியாது' (does not know delaying).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.87],[0.87,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.22],[2.3,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,3.95],[3.95,4.5],[4.5,5.6],[5.6,5.6],[5.6,5.6],[5.6,5.6],[5.6,6.15],[6.7,7.1],[7.1,7.33],[7.4,8.4],[8.4,8.5],[8.5,9.2],[9.2,10.0],[10.0,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,11.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.97],[0.97,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,2.56],[2.65,3.2],[3.2,3.7],[3.7,3.8],[4.19,4.58],[4.58,4.97],[4.97,4.97],[4.97,4.97],[4.97,4.97],[4.97,4.97],[4.97,6.54],[6.93,7.71],[8.1,9.5],[9.5,9.5],[9.5,10.4],[10.4,10.4],[10.4,12.1],[12.1,12.5],[12.5,12.7]]},"sync":[[["கானம்","forest"]],[["கோழி","fowl"]],[["கவர்","calling/attractive"],["குரல்","voiced"]],[["சேவல்","rooster"]],[["ஒண்பொறி","bright-spotted"]],[["எருத்தின்","on the neck"]],[["தண்சிதர்","cool drops"]],[["உறைப்ப","to drip"]],[["புதனீர்","water from the bushes"]],[["வாரும்","flowing"]],[["பூநாறு","flower-fragrant"]],[["புறவின்","of the woodland"]],[["சீறூர்","small village"]],[["சீறூர்","small village"],["ஓளே","she indeed is in"]],[["மடந்தை","the young woman"]],[["வேறூர்","to another town"]],[["வேந்துவிடு","sent by the king"]],[["தொழிலொடு","with duty"]],[["செலினும்","even if he goes"]],[["சேந்துவரல்","staying and returning"]],[["அறியாது","without knowing"]],[["செம்மல்","the lord's"]],[["தேரே","chariot indeed"]]]}